## Uniswap V3/V4 Specific

### Concentrated Liquidity Issues

```solidity
// Tick spacing vulnerabilities
// Wrong tick initialization
// Price range calculation errors

// CRITICAL - verify tick math
function validatePosition(int24 tickLower, int24 tickUpper) internal view {
    require(tickLower < tickUpper);
    require(tickLower >= TickMath.MIN_TICK);
    require(tickUpper <= TickMath.MAX_TICK);
    require(tickLower % tickSpacing == 0);
    require(tickUpper % tickSpacing == 0);
}
```

