## Curve-Specific Issues

### Read-Only Reentrancy

```solidity
// VULNERABLE - using virtual_price during callback
function getCollateralValue() view returns (uint256) {
    return balance * curve.get_virtual_price() / 1e18;
    // During remove_liquidity callback, this is STALE!
}

// SECURE - check for ongoing operations
function getCollateralValue() view returns (uint256) {
    require(!curve.is_locked(), "Pool locked");
    return balance * curve.get_virtual_price() / 1e18;
}
```

