## Balancer-Specific Issues

### Flash Loan + Pool Manipulation

```solidity
// Balancer pools can be exploited via flash loans
// Attack: borrow from pool, manipulate, interact with dependent protocol

// SECURE - use last block price or multiple sources
function getPoolPrice() view returns (uint256) {
    uint256 balancerPrice = getBalancerSpotPrice();
    uint256 chainlinkPrice = getChainlinkPrice();
    
    require(
        balancerPrice > chainlinkPrice * 95 / 100 &&
        balancerPrice < chainlinkPrice * 105 / 100,
        "Price deviation"
    );
}
