## DEX Audit Checklist

### Swap Security
- [ ] Slippage protection enforced (minAmountOut)
- [ ] Deadline parameter checked
- [ ] K invariant verified
- [ ] No reentrancy during swap
- [ ] Fee calculation correct
- [ ] Proper handling of fee-on-transfer tokens

### Liquidity
- [ ] First depositor attack mitigated (dead shares)
- [ ] LP token minting correct
- [ ] Remove liquidity reentrancy safe
- [ ] Correct share calculation
- [ ] No donation attacks

### Price Oracle
- [ ] TWAP window sufficient (>30 min)
- [ ] Manipulation resistance verified
- [ ] Stale price protection
- [ ] No read-only reentrancy

### Access Control
- [ ] Admin functions protected
- [ ] Fee changes bounded/timelocked
- [ ] Pause mechanisms appropriate

### Token Compatibility  
- [ ] Fee-on-transfer tokens handled
- [ ] Rebasing tokens considered
- [ ] Low decimal tokens work correctly
- [ ] tokens with callback (ERC777) safe
